		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">EtherCAT Terminal, 4 fail-safe digital outputs, 24 V DC</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">TwinSAFE output terminal: SO1 to SO4 on the terminals 1, 5, 3 and 7; the terminals 2, 6, 4 and 8 are 0 V. Terminal numbering follows the user's own drawing and is NOT verified against the datasheet: check it before use.</elementInformation>
