		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">RCBO iDPNa Vigi, 1P+N, 16 A, C curve, 4.5 kA, type AC, 30 mA. Width 2 x 9 mm (18 mm). Terminals: phase 1-2, neutral N1-N2. Replaced by iCV40 in the catalogue.</elementInformation>
